Q: Passing data to handlebars - node.js A: <p>I was facing similar problem. Here is how I solved it</p>
<pre><code>{{#each all_users}}
  &lt;tr&gt;
    &lt;td headers=&quot;name&quot;&gt;{{displayName}}&lt;/td&gt;
  &lt;/tr&gt;
{{/each}}
</code></pre>
<p>Remove all the <code>value[0]</code> stuff etc. Above code will work fine.</p>

